            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a vacuum adiabatic body. The vacuum adiabatic body includes an outer case made of a metal material, which is thicker than a plate providing a vacuum space. The vacuum space provides two extension modules that extend in directions different from each other. Accordingly, a refrigerator door may be improved in adiabatic performance.</p>
            </abstract>
